"[HEADER] apworld / yaml Infos",
"kill",
"Minecraft is not a core Archipelago game, it needs a custom world file. When 'minecraft.apworld' is downloaded in the Archipelago Folder (by clicking START SETUP), boot-up the Archipelago Launcher and go to 'Options Creator' to create your .yaml file and then, when you're done, send it to the person who will host the AP Multiworld.",
